WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.006
Setup walkthrough: prepare a new PC

00:00:05.006 --> 00:00:13.005
Missing .NET? Choose Download

00:00:13.005 --> 00:00:18.156
Then Install the Desktop Runtime

00:00:18.156 --> 00:00:22.994
Offline PC? Bring both Microsoft runtime installers first.

00:00:22.994 --> 00:00:27.982
Continue when the runtime is ready

00:00:27.982 --> 00:00:38.998
Install WebView2 for the new previewer

00:00:38.998 --> 00:00:45.002
Next: choose where SEARCH-IN is installed

00:00:45.002 --> 00:00:53.997
Install SEARCH-IN after both prerequisites

00:00:53.997 --> 00:01:00.000
Finish, then open the Content Indexer
